flowchart TB
  subgraph client [客户端]
    Web[控制台]
    Embed[嵌入展现]
  end
  subgraph api [API 服务]
    Auth[身份与权限]
    Biz[业务能力域]
  end
  subgraph data [数据层]
    Meta[平台元数据]
    Store[托管分析库]
  end
  subgraph ext [外部]
    Src[业务数据源]
    Bus[数据交换总线]
  end
  Web --> Auth
  Embed --> Auth
  Auth --> Biz
  Biz --> Meta
  Biz --> Store
  Biz --> Src
  Biz --> Bus
